ountry as he says these tragedies are  preventable this should not happen  and not at all and should not happen  again now i'm told five of those seven  family members will be buried here in  las vegas if you would like to continue  helping the family we have posted that  gofundme page on our website  eightnewsnow.com reporting sally  jaramillo live local now
 

